// Axiom Compiler — PE32+ Import Table Synthesis & Runtime Stubs (compiler/link/import.ax)
// Port of IAT/ILT synthesis, DLL import discovery, jump thunks, and startup/runtime
// stubs (axiom_start, axiom_panic, __ax_host_print, __ax_host_print_int) from
// bootstrap/axiom0/src/link/pe/linker.c.
